<p>NOTE: Net loss for the first quarter of 1997 included a $4.0 million non-cash charge, of which $3.0 million relates to a reserve against the tax assets created as a result of the first quarter loss and $1.0 million related to an additional charge to increase the company's reserve against net deferred tax assets. At March 31, the reserve was approximately $6.6 million.</p>
<p>Full company name is Submicron Systems Corp. -- ((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
